RFC 7208 4.6.4: at most 10 mechanisms and modifiers that do DNS lookups
per SPF check. Each include started its own count from zero, so a record
with 10 includes of a record with 10 includes, nested up to the depth
limit of 20, made 10^20 lookups; one sender could stall the receiving
MTA. The count now goes through includes, and the term over the limit
is a permerror before its lookup rather than after it.

